 "about": "UNCOUNTED heat program (user T-247): hard fast flings, most of the run at the end of the page (repeated close/open of the end-of-page menu), two full-page top-bottom passes. No timing is read from it. Fixed repeats and optional untils only; every down fling sits in a one-pass runtime loop (until atTop) so a pull-to-refresh guard miss ends that loop instead of aborting the run. Start on an open page, no reload.",
